{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2313, nearly 300 years have passed since the planet was struck by the \u201cSeed.\u201d The Seed is a colonization weapon created by an advanced civilization. It alters the natural environment of a planet, making it hostile to humans while spawning predators designed to eradicate all life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity discovered the existence of the Seed a century later\u2014but by then it was already too late. Earth had become a shattered world. Refusing to accept extinction, humanity began a plan that would span centuries. And one day, you will awaken to carry it out\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike + Extraction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines Roguelike mechanics with extraction gameplay. Players can scavenge valuable resources and obtain items that enhance character abilities. Every run offers new challenges and exciting combat. In this world, surviving and extracting may be more important than fighting to the end.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras/693820f88a74927e597211809e1b1a05.avif?t=1773371297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras_big/693820f88a74927e597211809e1b1a05.avif?t=1773371297 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras/9ee74ea7a0ba281e9e6e6128a7fe1b33.avif?t=1773371297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras_big/9ee74ea7a0ba281e9e6e6128a7fe1b33.avif?t=1773371297 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a wide selection of characters and weapons. Equipment can be found while exploring the map, or obtained through trading and crafting.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras/098a8413ffdfcb9834eb5580d534969b.avif?t=1773371297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras_big/098a8413ffdfcb9834eb5580d534969b.avif?t=1773371297 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pre-Equipped Buff Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff items are no longer completely random. Players can equip multiple enhancement items before entering a run, making it easier to create powerful builds. These items can also be found, purchased, or crafted during gameplay.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras/4bb8524616a39d519287158679928f42.avif?t=1773371297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras_big/4bb8524616a39d519287158679928f42.avif?t=1773371297 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an infinite map generation system. Battles are no longer confined by boundaries, and each map may contain its own gameplay mode, creating endless and unpredictable combat experiences.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras/44e5dd519e5a75144756856ae60bef0c.avif?t=1773371297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras_big/44e5dd519e5a75144756856ae60bef0c.avif?t=1773371297 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various structures can be built across different maps. Some fight alongside you, some restore your health, and others recharge your energy. Building them in the field may completely change how each run unfolds.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras/fb8ddb0804ad90952d43583814c09b9f.avif?t=1773371297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras_big/fb8ddb0804ad90952d43583814c09b9f.avif?t=1773371297 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Affinity System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain items can be given to NPCs to increase affinity. Higher affinity grants discounts on their goods and better rewards when selling items to them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras/69ab966d8e5c53baf9ee2b757b716e5b.avif?t=1773371297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras_big/69ab966d8e5c53baf9ee2b757b716e5b.avif?t=1773371297 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859940?t=1773371297","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/75ee47959b818f597840a03ace5f47ffbfce0824/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773371297","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/c1d4480ab7d77541ffa9921aab2df881a90daffd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773371297","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/c1d4480ab7d77541ffa9921aab2df881a90daffd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773371297","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_suppor