lding them in the field may completely change how each run unfolds.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras/fb8ddb0804ad90952d43583814c09b9f.avif?t=1773371297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras_big/fb8ddb0804ad90952d43583814c09b9f.avif?t=1773371297 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Affinity System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain items can be given to NPCs to increase affinity. Higher affinity grants discounts on their goods and better rewards when selling items to them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras/69ab966d8e5c53baf9ee2b757b716e5b.avif?t=1773371297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/extras_big/69ab966d8e5c53baf9ee2b757b716e5b.avif?t=1773371297 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["DaShanGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859940/f5b07d29f72528839c8c2a75f13ec8d2235a7780/header.jpg?t=1773371297","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This game is an original work by the developers. All game content (including but not limited to code, artwork, sound effects, music, and scripts) is either original, legally licensed, or created using freely usable resources.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWithout permission, decompiling, cracking, unpacking, modifying, distributing, or using the game for other commercial purposes is strictly prohibited.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game does not contain any content that infringes upon third-party intellectual property rights. Any third-party engines, plugins, libraries, or tools used comply with their res